<title>USA: Heftel Broadcasting Q1 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Heftel Broadcasting Q1 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit	     $  0.03     loss	$ 0.10</p>
<p> Net profit		   565     loss	   972</p>
<p> Revs			23,029		   15,696</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,142		   10,103</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Heftel Broadcasting Corp.</p>
<p>Outstanding shares increased in 1997 Q1 on issuance of shares in conjunction with Tichenor Merger and a secondary offering.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 results include charge of $0.07 per shr for discontinued operations of its network subsidiary, Cadena Radio Centro. Before charge 1996 Q1 net loss was $307,859 or $0.03 per share.</p>
